        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The English version is scheduled to be updated progressively for free.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please look forward to the completion of the translation from the Japanese version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ortho Blaze is a completely new RPG that inherited the spirit of our circle game ``Blaze of the Orthos''.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an alternative action battle and narrative RPG that revolves around an ancient genie legend and the thoughts of many characters intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The appeal is the carefully planned scenario, the 2D dotted world, and the exhilarating feeling of defeating enemies with dynamic techniques in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658550/extras/65ffa5dd77c6c652830981320df08478.avif?t=1770377082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658550/extras_big/65ffa5dd77c6c652830981320df08478.avif?t=1770377082 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize your battle skills and take advantage of each character's strengths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658550/extras/d1f04622696dbf8c25c2ca022429f346.poster.avif?t=1770377082\" width=170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658550/extras/d1f04622696dbf8c25c2ca022429f346.webm?t=1770377082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658550/extras/d1f04622696dbf8c25c2ca022429f346.mp4?t=1770377082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose between two modes of character graphics in battle: &quot;short&quot; and &quot;tall&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll do be excited the tense combat in both modes!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The English version is scheduled to be updated progressively for free.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please look forward to the completion of the translation from the Japanese version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ortho Blaze is a completely new RPG that inherited the spirit of our circle game ``Blaze of the Orthos''.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an alternative action battle and narrative RPG that revolves around an ancient genie legend and the thoughts of many characters intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The appeal is the carefully planned scenario, the 2D dotted world, and the exhilarating feeling of defeating enemies with dynamic techniques in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658550/extras/65ffa5dd77c6c652830981320df08478.avif?t=1770377082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658550/extras_big/65ffa5dd77c6c652830981320df08478.avif?t=1770377082 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize your battle skills and take advantage of each character's strengths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658550/extras/d1f04622696dbf8c25c2ca022429f346.poster.avif?t=1770377082\" width=170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658550/extras/d1f04622696dbf8c25c2ca022429f346.webm?t=1770377082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658550/extras/d1f04622696dbf8c25c2ca022429f346.mp4?t=1770377082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose between two modes of character graphics in battle: &quot;short&quot; and &quot;tall&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll do be excited the tense combat in both modes!</p>",
        "short_description": "This is an alternative action battle and narrative RPG that revolves around an ancient genie legend and the thoughts of many characters intertwine. The appeal is the carefully planned scenario, the 2D dotted world, and the exhilarating feeling of defeating enemies with dynamic techniques in battle.",
        "supported_languages": "Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
        "reviews": "“The game features a highly distinctive UI. The option to adjust character scale (larger or smaller sprites) during battle is a subtle but noteworthy design choice.  Although it uses a random encounter system, well-timed button inputs allow for preemptive strikes or even avoiding battles entirely, which feels fresh and engaging.  While fundamentally an RPG, the game includes many “just action” mechanics, making it feel almost like a hybrid action game.”<br>PLiCy<br>",
